abstract: >-
  Code, recorded runs and claim ledger for the paper "Exact Distance-Only Complexity of Small Topologies". The
  repository holds an exact player of Cai's transcript-cone game for the
  distance-only complexity OPT_DIST of small rooted directed topologies, an
  exact player of the fed cycle's path-register game against restricted
  adversaries, independent z3-based reference players, an evaluator of
  uniform local-rule programs, and every recorded run the paper's numbers
  come from.
